 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "a33357de-ab5b-4303-ab0b-d6967862511e",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36694183-19f3-80ce-af6c-fc32055e0f26"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-20T09:39:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-06-02T10:27:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "paragraph",
  "paragraph": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "Contigo GmbH's agent can now hold conversations using Buffer Memory, isolate sessions using Session IDs, and manage context length using Buffer Window Memory. The technical foundations are in place. But having a working memory configuration and having a well-designed one are not the same thing",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "Contigo GmbH's agent can now hold conversations using Buffer Memory, isolate sessions using Session IDs, and manage context length using Buffer Window Memory. The technical foundations are in place. But having a working memory configuration and having a well-designed one are not the same thing",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "icon": null,
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "afb196e9-021b-401e-a825-83c8c24d3a6b",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36694183-19f3-80ce-af6c-fc32055e0f26"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-20T09:39:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-06-02T10:27:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "paragraph",
  "paragraph": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "In testing, Contigo's team has already encountered three recurring problems. The agent occasionally stores information it should not; including details that create privacy exposure. Its long-term memory database is growing faster than expected, with large amounts of content that is never retrieved and never useful. And in one instance, a piece of incorrect information stored early in a session persisted across turns, causing the agent to give a client inaccurate guidance for several exchanges before a human reviewer caught it.",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "In testing, Contigo's team has already encountered three recurring problems. The agent occasionally stores information it should not; including details that create privacy exposure. Its long-term memory database is growing faster than expected, with large amounts of content that is never retrieved and never useful. And in one instance, a piece of incorrect information stored early in a session persisted across turns, causing the agent to give a client inaccurate guidance for several exchanges before a human reviewer caught it.",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "icon": null,
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
 {
  "object": "block",
  "id": "d4b037eb-dbbb-4945-be31-8d5f20c1ee65",
  "parent": {
   "type": "page_id",
   "page_id": "36694183-19f3-80ce-af6c-fc32055e0f26"
  },
  "created_time": "2026-05-20T09:39:00.000Z",
  "last_edited_time": "2026-05-23T23:42:00.000Z",
  "created_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "last_edited_by": {
   "object": "user",
   "id": "231d872b-594c-81f2-a375-0002b8783aca"
  },
  "has_children": false,
  "in_trash": false,
  "type": "paragraph",
  "paragraph": {
   "rich_text": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": {
      "content": "None of these are configuration errors. They are design errors and they are the result of not having clear rules for how memory should behave. ",
      "link": null
     },
     "annotations": {
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false,
      "strikethrough": false,
      "underline": false,
      "code": false,
      "color": "default"
     },
     "plain_text": "None of these are configuration errors. They are design errors and they are the result of not having clear rules for how memory should behave. ",
     "href": null
    }
   ],
   "icon": null,
   "color": "default"
  },
  "archived": false
 },
